# DRAFT - patch 文件 --/+++ 行带本机绝对路径导致 git apply 拒绝（absolute paths are not allowed）
# 与同 stem 的 DRAFT-patch-absolute-path-git-apply-rejected.md 成对（同字段/同主题）
# 来源：cloog 0.21.1（PR #9045）+ dfu 0.11（PR #9176）适配，2026-09-09

id: DRAFT-PATCH-ABSOLUTE-PATH-GIT-APPLY-REJECTED
stem: DRAFT-patch-absolute-path-git-apply-rejected
severity: 3
category: patch, git-apply, portability, conan-recipe, autotools
tools: git, git-apply, patch, conan, diff
stage: apply_patches, build

error_signature: |
  patch: error: absolute paths are not allowed - file no.1|
  stripping absolute path from source name 'b'/storage/Users/currentUser/.tmp/xxx-fresh/...''|
  stripping absolute path from target name 'b'/storage/Users/currentUser/.tmp/xxx-build/...''|
  source/target file does not exist:
    --- b'Users/currentUser/.tmp/xxx-fresh/...'
    +++ b'Users/currentUser/.tmp/xxx-build/...'|
  ConanException: Failed to apply patch: .../patches/0001-xxx.patch

root_cause: |
  在 /tmp 下解压新旧两份源码做对比生成 patch（diff -ruN /tmp/xxx-fresh
  /tmp/xxx-build 或脚本产出），patch 的 ---/+++ 行带着本机绝对路径
  （/storage/Users/currentUser/.tmp/...）。git apply 拒绝绝对路径
  （absolute paths are not allowed，防路径穿越），剥离前缀后路径变成
  b'Users/currentUser/...（引号残留 + 截断）必然 apply 失败。
  patch 的路径行是 patch 元数据的一部分，必须与仓库相对路径匹配，
  不能用生成它的机器路径。cloog 0.21.1 3 个 patch 全中招 CI 失败；
  dfu 0.11 同模式生成同样风险。

recommendation: |
  git-relative-patch-paths
  (1) 用 git diff 生成：git 仓库内改完源码 git diff 产出 --- a/<rel> /
      +++ b/<rel> 标准格式（推荐）；
  (2) 用 diff 生成时保证相对路径：新旧源码分别放 a/、b/ 子目录后
      diff -ruN a b，或在源码根内 diff 使路径行为相对路径；
  (3) 生成后自检：grep -E '^--- |^\+\+\+ ' *.patch 必须全部是 a/<rel>
      / b/<rel>，出现 /storage/、/tmp/ 等绝对路径即不合格；
  (4) conan 配方验证：本地 conan create 确认 apply 通过——但绝对路径
      patch 本地侥幸通过、CI 必失败的陷阱，本地验证通过不代表 CI 通过。

verification: |
  grep -E '^--- |^\+\+\+ ' patches/*.patch   # 必须全为 a/ b/ 相对路径
  conan create archives/c/cloog/0.21.1 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64
  # 预期：3 个 patch Apply 成功，EXIT=0

keywords: |
  patch, git apply, absolute paths are not allowed, diff -ruN, ---/+++ 行,
  relative path, a/b prefix, conan, apply_conandata_patches, ConanException,
  cloog, dfu, OHOS, portability
